<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id" />
  <para style="h">1 Pita</para>
  <para style="toc1">Neletes Namun Pita Mey Am̄ag</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Pita</para>
  <para style="toc3">1PI</para>
  <para style="rem">Backtranslated by Fr. John Ralph,</para>
  <para style="rem">(Start typing by Grace –26/06/06)</para>
  <para style="rem">(Completed typing – 1st July 2006)</para>
  <para style="mt">Neletes Namun Pita Mey Am̄ag</para>
  <para style="is">Nakaka non 1 Pita Qelegēn</para>
  <para style="ip">Net tin̄qoy non Tigsas Kraēs a mayap neletes gōh nahan Pita. Pita en, ikē nahal mey a Tigsas movon yak kē so nitig helem̄ag nēm̄ yon̄ del.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pita mayap neletes geh gōh tō mēvētleg walēg nēm̄ yon̄ del. Kē nemyōs so vasusup kēy so tig maymay lēdēmtig nonoy.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pita mayap neletes geh gōh yakhagyeh hiy ige Krēstēn mey a kēy et age Tujuw te, ba am̄ag kēy ige tog lolqōn̄. Kēy mavan me ige Krēstēn, tō muwulyis den namtevuy mey nehet tam̄ag. Veg kēy mak qelenen, tō ige sil telepnō nonoy mitig het kēy aē. Pita mavahiy kēy so dēmsas nēwē del a Ḡod mavawē kēy aē, tō togtog wa yon̄teg naln̄an Tigsas.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pita mavap van hiy ige Krēstēn so Ḡod mal ōlōl kēy so kēy nitiy et nonon. Kē mohole gatay ige Krēstēn haytēyēh qele nohohole Nayapyap Tēnēte Labaybol, a Ḡod mohole gatay ige Tujuw. Am̄ag, kē metyak ige Juw so kēy nitiy sil nonon. Togtōkē, Ḡod melep van nēh lap hiy ige Krēstēn. Tō kē mētēymat nayseyse mey nēwē hag lōtōk alge en. Tō lōqōn̄ a Tigsas tavan lokse me en, kēy telep tiwag mi kē nēlēn̄as wa nēdēmap. Ba togtōkē Ḡod mukēg me nememeh so nihlet etgal nēdēmtig nonoy, tō so vasemlō so nēdēmtig nonoy en hēyhēywē.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pita mavahiy maymay ige Krēstēn so tig netnet ba nitog m̄ōlm̄ōl lok lemtehal het tam̄ag. Pita mavap van hiy kēy so kēy ak tenenen nēmētwuy van lengon ige lolqōn̄ tō so kēy telep kal nahan Ḡod aē. Ḡod nemyōs so ige nonon dēmap ige del, tam ige et non Kraēs, mētēgteg Ḡod, wa dēmap mayanag nonoy. Ba so Ḡod wo mukēg kēy so yon̄ memeh, tiy wē yeh so kēy yon̄ memeh tōtēn namgumgu togolgol den namgumgu mey nehet. Veg Kraēs en, kē net tenenen ba kē moyon̄ memeh veg ige gengenyeg. Wa tō ige Krēstēn so dam namakaliw nonon.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Den Pita, nahal non Tigsas Kraēs.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:1">Hiy kimi en, ige a Ḡod metyak tō, ige a qeleso nahalvan vel vōnō, a lepnō Pontus, Ḡalasia, Kapadosia, Esia wa Bithinia. <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />Ḡod Imam mal vonyak vatag tō kimi am̄ag a lemyōs nonon mahgen. Tō kē niak yon̄ kimi mi Nuvu, tō so kimi yon̄teg Tigsas Kraēs, wa naday nonon nioh wenwen kimi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Nasgōp nitog tiwag mi kimi wa natm̄at niōyheg kimi.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dēm lok nahaphap ēwē a Ḡod mal lep me hiy gēn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />!Ōl liwo Ḡod, Imam non Welan nongēn Tigsas Kraēs! Kē mak tō gēn mowot lokse veg bemgaysēn liwo nonon. Ḡod melep me nēh gayaq nan hiy gēn heylō nage a kē mak hiy Tigsas Kraēs en, a Tigsas mēh lok den namatmat. Bastō gēn nēglal galsi so gēn telep navawē non Ḡod, tō nitiy dēmdēm nan niak maymay gēn. <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />Veg gēn mowot lokse en, gēn dēmdēyē vel haphap mey nēwē a Ḡod mak tēymat tō how hiy gēn a ige yantēntēn. Nahaphap gōh tit saq vēhte, tit het vēhte, wa nangoy tit hay vēhte. Veg Ḡod netgoy galsi nahaphap nan hag lōtōk en hiy kimi. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Tō Ḡod nietetgoy kimi mi naman nonon, heylō nēdēmtig nonmi, gaydēn̄ a kē tavasemlō nahaphap ēwē nonmi mahē kē nivaēh kimi a babah ne qōn̄.<verse eid="1PE 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Veg bege gōh kimi malaklak. Ba kimi wun lolwon ēwē natkelgi veg nememeh tegtegha mal van me hiy kimi. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Ḡod mukēg me nememeh nan so nihlet etgal nēdēmtig nonmi, tō so vasemlō so nēdēmtig nonmi en hēyhēywē. Nēdēmtig nonmi en qeleso nōḡōl<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nōḡōl en, kē natle a nēbēybēy. Kēy tin̄tin̄ nēsēm aē tiwag mi yatkel haphap beplakas ne taqn̄ige.</char></note>. Net nim̄ōk nōḡōl lep tō so hilhil etgal so kē itōktōk lēs. Nōḡōl tohol qelen̄ vēh, ba nēdēmtig nonmi itōk veteg nōḡōl. Ḡod mehlet etgal nēdēmtig nonmi tō so nēdēmtig nonmi toyowōlsēn yow so kimi telep nōliwo, nēlēn̄as wa nēdēmap lōqōn̄ a Ḡod tavasemlō me Tigsas Kraēs.<verse eid="1PE 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Kimi et etsas qete Tigsas, ba kimi natam kē, wa kimi et etsas te kē qiyig agōh, ba kimi nēdēmtig kē. Tō kimi nōyheg mi namlaklak liwo wa mi nam̄sēksēk a tit hole gatay qēt vēhte. <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />Kimi nemlaklak veg kimi mal tēy nayseyse bēdēmtig nonmi en. Nayseyse nan en Ḡod mal vaēh kimi.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10-11" />Am̄ag ige lēgēlgēg melgēg veg nasgōp a Ḡod melep van hiy kimi qiyig gōh. Heylō kēy en, Nuvu non Kraēs mohole so Kraēs toyon̄ memeh, tō atgiy, kē telep nēlēn̄as. Ige lēgēlgēg mosok lōlhiy so Nuvu mohole gatay ihē, si so lahan qōn̄. <verse eid="1PE 1:10-11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Nahal gōh en, ige in̄sel nemyōs so ēglal temuy se. Ba Ḡod maklō van hiy ige lēgēlgēg, kēy et mugumgu te veg kēy mahgey, ba kēy mugumgu veg kimi. !Tō nahal gōh mal dēn̄ kimi! Ige botoytoy noyoy ēwē mavasemlō nahal nan hiy kimi mi namaymay non Nuvu Yon̄ a Ḡod mēvētleg me den lōtōk.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kimi so yon̄ veg Ḡod noyon̄</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Sōwlē, atmi tēytēymat nēdēmdēm nonmi bemgumgu. Dēm m̄ōleg galsi, tō dēmdēyē vaga van hiy nasgōp mey Ḡod telep van hiy kimi mahē kē tavasemlō Tigsas Kraēs. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Qele a nēnētm̄ey notog leln̄e yon̄teg non imam nonon, atmi yon̄teg Ḡod. Ba namyōs het nonmi mey a kimi madamdam tō am̄ag mey a kimi et ēglal te Ḡod en, atmi nitog damdam tatag van. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Mey a mōlōl kimi en, kē noyon̄, tō kimi mas van me yon̄ qele ikē a lemtevumi del. <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />Veg Layapyap Yon̄ en, Ḡod wo, “Kimi so yon̄, veg ino noyon̄.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Lev. 11:44,45; Lev. 19:2; Lev. 20:7</char></note><verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Mahē kimi ōlōl hiy Ḡod so kē ‘Imam,’ dēmsas so kē tēvēvēg velvel et tatag van lemgumgu nonoy. Tō itōk so kimi dēmap galsi kē mi namtevumi mey newenwen lēh del nonmi a kimi togtō qele ige halvan lemyam agōh. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Dēm lok so Ḡod meplet yak kimi den nēvēnami mey nehet tam̄ag, a yeghuquy ēwē. Kē et velet te kimi mi nage a tasaq vēh qele nōḡōl si nēsēlva<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nēsēlva en, kē natle a nēbēybēy. Kēy tin̄tin̄ nēsēm aē tiwag mi yatkel haphap beplakas ne taqn̄ige. Nōḡōl neketket den nēsēlva.</char></note>. <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />Ba kē meplet yak kimi mi naday non Kraēs, a nitiy ketket yeh, qele ninti sipsip mey a newenwen a newenwen, a kēy olol aē. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Ḡod movonyak Kraēs am̄ag den naqtēqtēg ne mayam, tō maklō kē a babah ne qōn̄. Kē maklō kē me bēwē nonmi. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Heylō Kraēs en, kimi mal van me ige a nēdēmtig Ḡod. Ḡod gōh a melep kal lok kē den namatmat, tō melep nēlēn̄as hiy kē. Bastō kimi dēmdēyē Ḡod, wa dēmtig kē.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Atmi vēy tamtam kimi veg kimi mal wot lokse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Togtōkē en, kimi mal ak wenwen natqami veg a kimi motog tō leln̄e yon̄teg ne hohole nēhēyhēywē. Mak tō nitiy tamtam aē mi kimi so tam yathithimi wa yatētētami. Sōwlē, atmi vey tamtam kimi mi nitiy tamtam van lelo taqami del.<verse eid="1PE 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Itōk so kimi vey tamtam kimi veg kimi mal wot lokse. Tō nowotwot lokse et van te me den lōtōti haphap mey a tasaq, ba mavan me den lōtōti haphap a tit saq vēhte. Kimi mowot lokse heylō nohohole non Ḡod, nohohole nan a nēh vaga wa nitog lap mi kimi. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Veg Nayapyap Yon̄ mavap wo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">“Net del qeleso naplih</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">Wa nēlēn̄as nonoy qele natawhi vilih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">ba naplih nan temyen̄,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">tō natawhēy tisisisgoy,<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />ba nohohole non Welan Ḡod notogtog lap vaga.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Isaiah 40:6-8</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:25">Tō nohohole gōh en, noyoy ēwē a kēy mal vasemlō vatag tō van hiy kimi.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Yēhē, veg kimi mal wot lokse en, atmi ukēg veteg nēmētwumi del mey nehet; nitog galgal, nitog vēyvēyle, nitog qeneqneg, wa nitog vavap hethet hiy net tegha. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Qeleso ige nēnētm̄ey susu a kēy maygay hiy nisis tō so kēy so liwo, atmi maygay se hiy negengen non Ḡod, a so niak maymay nēdēmtig, tō so kimi tilwo haytēyēh van lamakaliw non ige mey a Ḡod mavaēh tō. <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />!Veg kimi mal helet etgal van so Welan itōk!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 34:8</char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kimi nitiy et non Ḡod a so ōl liwo Kraēs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Welan ikē nevet<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lēvēnan ige Juw en, mahē kēy so wos nēm̄ mi nevet en, kēy mōm̄ōk nevet vitwag so van me nitiy han̄tig ne ēm̄ mey a tak maymay nēm̄.</char></note> a nēh, a ige et mal visipteg, ba Ḡod mal vonyak vatag. Tō nevet nan nitiy wē hiy kē. Kimi vanvan hiy Welan en, <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />tō kimi se qeleso nevet a nēh, nevet mey a kēy woswos ēm̄ aē. Tō Ḡod nim̄ōk ketket nēm̄ van aē. Tō kimi van me qele nēm̄ mey a Nuvu Yon̄ notogtog alon. Ḡod mak tō so kimi van me ige pris nonon, so lep van nolol hiy kē. Tō nolol nonmi en, ikē Buvu, ikē namgumgu a netgolgol lengon heylō Tigsas Kraēs.<verse eid="1PE 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Veg Nayapyap Yon̄ nivap so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">“!Atmi et tow van! Nok gilgeg nevet a Saeon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">nok gilgeg nahan̄ vet nan a no mal etyak, a nitiy wē yeh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">Tō net mey a nēdēmtig kē en,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">kē tit mamayge vēhte.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Isaiah 28:16</char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Nevet nan nitiy wē yeh hiy kimi a nēdēmtig. Ba kēy a et dēmtig te en, kē et buste kē qele Nayapyap Yon̄ mavap so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">Nahan̄ vet mey a ige bētēytēy ēm̄ mepsipteg tō en, kē may van me nam̄e han̄.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 118:22</char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />Wa tō,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">Nevet gōh en, nisil tititeg vēh mi kē, wa tō nevet nan tak sisgoy kēy.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Isaiah 8:14</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 2:8">Kēy tititeg veg kēy et yon̄teg te nahal, ba Ḡod mal m̄ōk vatag namtehal nan van hiy kēy.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Ba veg kimi en, Ḡod mal vonyak vatag kimi so van me ige nonon. Tō kimi ige viwti pris nonon Mayanag. Kimi niviwti et a noyon̄. Kimi ige yon̄ non Ḡod a kē mal vēl yakyak kimi so ige nonon. Ḡod movonyak kimi qelegōh so kimi so vasemlō vel mugumgu nonon mey nēwē a kē mak tō, ikē mey a mal lepyak kimi den namlēglēg, tō mal lep kimi me lemyeyen liwo nonon. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Am̄ag en kimi niviwti tegtegha, ba togtōkē kimi mal van me nitiy et non Ḡod.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Hosea 1:10, 2:1</char></note> Am̄ag, tateh len̄emagaysēn non Ḡod van hiy kimi, ba togtōkē Ḡod nemgaysēn kimi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Hosea 1:6, 2:1</char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Namtehal ne dēmap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Yēhē bulsal, kimi nahalvan ēwē a tog tō lemyam agōh, veg kimi en telemyeyen talge. Tō namyōs het ne taqn̄imi mey a nivagapgal tiwag mi natalami, nitog damdam van. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Ak tenenen galsi nēmētwumi van lengon ige lolqōn̄. Togtōkē kēy tohole hethet hiy kimi bemgumgu tōgōlgōl nonmi. Ba kēy telep kal nahan Ḡod aē babah ne qōn̄.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Veg kimi ige nonon Welan en, kimi so yon̄teg wa dēmap ige lililwo nonmi. Atmi dēmap mayanag a kē nitiy liwo yeh lakapman. <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />Wa tō kimi so yon̄teg ige mayanag a kē mēvētleg kēy van lepnō vivitwag so nivēvēg ige a helhel nele, wa tō ōlwē ige tenenen. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Ḡod nemyōs so kimi galeg namgumgu mey nēwē, tō so namgumgu nan nitabeg nan̄yan ige qōy mey a kēy lēlēlhiy kimi. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Itōk so kimi tog haytēyēh van lamakaliw non ige a notog m̄ōleg. Ba Ḡod et ukēg taywah te kimi tō so kimi dam namakaliw a nehet, tateh. Atmi tog qele ige et mugumgu non Ḡod. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Atmi dēmap ige del, tam ige et non Kraēs, mētēgteg Ḡod, wa dēmap mayanag nonmi.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahē kimi yon̄ memeh, dam namakaliw non Kraēs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Yēhē, ige slev, yon̄teg galsi ige welan nonmi wa dēmap galsi kēy. Nitog dēdēmap vēlēs ige welan a kēy net lolwē kimi wa nēwē mi kimi, ba dēmap se ige welan mey a nehet. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Ḡod tavawē kimi mahē a ige wo mak memeh kimi yeghuquy, tō kimi nitig netnet veg kimi nēdēmap Ḡod. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />?Ba kēy wo mēvēvēg kimi veg kimi megengenyeg en, kimi dēm van so kimi telep nayseyse aē veg kimi nitig netnet? Tateh. Ba kimi wo mak nahaphap mey netnenen, tō kēy wo mēvēvēg kimi aē en, Ḡod tavawē kimi.<verse eid="1PE 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Ḡod mal ōlōl kimi so dam tatag nabalban Tigsas. Tō Tigsas moyon̄ memeh tōtēn kimi. Ikē namakaliw hiy kimi, qeleso kē moyon̄ memeh en, tō kimi se so yon̄ memeh.<verse eid="1PE 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />Nayapyap Yon̄ nihohole gatay kē so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:22">Kē et gengenyeg hōn te,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:22">wa tō tateh galgal geh nikalō me den naplan.<verse eid="1PE 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Mahē a ige sil hohole hethet van hiy kē en, kē et lep lok te so nihole hethet van hiy kēy. Mahē kē moyon̄ memeh en, kē et vap te so nilep lok naday nonon. Ba kē mamatēg vēlēs van hiy Ḡod, a kē tēvēvēg ige del lemtehal tenenen. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Heylō lataqn̄ēn, kē m̄eywu negengenyeg del nongēn apwo wolwol tō so gēn bah den negengenyeg, wa ēh tō so tog tenenen van hiy kē. Veg kimi mēwē heylō lemtewot nonon. Kimi so bah qēt den negengenyeg, tō so tog tenenen ēwē.<verse eid="1PE 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Veg am̄ag kimi qeleso nisipsip a meqlen̄ tō, ba togtōkē kimi mal van lok me hiy Kraēs. Ikē nitiy et betet goy sipsip, tō kē tetgoy galsi kimi.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Navatvatne hiy ige leg</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Ey, ige lōqōvēn leg, itōk so kimi yon̄teg galsi ige tam̄an nonmi. Kimi tewseg ēwē kēy me hiy Ḡod en heylō lēmētwumi mey nēwē. Qeleso kēy wo et yon̄teg te nohohole non Ḡod en, ba kēy tēdēmtig vēh <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />mahē a kēy et nēmētwumi wa nēdēmap nonmi, ba et heylō te lohohole nonmi.<verse eid="1PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Atmi valakas galsi kimi mi nahaphap mey nēwē nelelo taqn̄ige ba et mi nahaphap taslil netaybege te. Nitog dēmdēm van hiy neleleh a neplakas qeleso nōḡōl, si viy nilimi, si so hey neleleh a neplakas galsi. <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />Ba nitiy wē yeh so atmi valakas nalo taqn̄imi mi natm̄at, wa mi namhuy, mey a tit hay qelen̄ vēhte. Lengon Ḡod, nalqōvēn qelegōh itōktōk a itōktōk lēs.<verse eid="1PE 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Veg bemtehal gōh, ige lōqōvēn yon̄ tam̄ag mey a mēdēmdēyē Ḡod en, kēy meplakas tō kēy qeleanen. Kēy moyon̄teg galsi tō ige tam̄an nonoy <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />qeleso Sera, a kē moyon̄teg galsi tō Abraham. Tō kē mōlōl kē a so “Welan mino.” Tō kimi wo tit mētēgteg vēhte, ba mak nahaphap mey nēwē, tō kimi gōh ige yantēntēn Sera.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Qelese gōh, ige tam̄an leg atmi tog muhuy tiwag mi ige lōqōvēn nonmi, veg kēy nem̄geygey den kimi, a kēy temtēgteg nahaphap a kimi ak maymay hiy kēy. Tō dēmap kēy veg kimi haytēyēh van lengon Ḡod. Nasgōp del ne ēh a kē melep van hiy kimi en, kē melep se van hiy ige lōqōvēn. Sōwō, atmi kokm̄egoy galsi kēy tō so natatay nonmi tit van yeghuquy vēhte.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yam lok nehet mi navawē tō so Ḡod tē lep navawē hiy kimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Babah ne hohole mino hiy kimi del qelegēn, tog tēy nuvu del ne qultiwag. Atmi vey magamgaysēn kimi, vey tamtam kimi, vey biyimyin̄ kimi, wa dēm bēbēw kimi. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Nitog yamyam lok nehet van hiy nehet si so yamyam lok nohohole het mi nohohole het. Ba yam lok nehet mi navawē. Veg bege nan en Ḡod mal ōlōl vatag kimi, tō kimi tētēy navawē aē.<verse eid="1PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Veg Nayapyap Yon̄ mavap so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">“Ihēte a nimyōs nēh a itōktōk lēs,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">wa nietet namlaklak ne qōn̄ mey nēwē en,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">kē tagatgoy nagayman den nohohole hethet,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">wa nan̄yan den nagalgal.<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />Kē niwulyis den nahaphap mey nehet,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">wa niak nahaphap mey netgolgol.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:11">Kē nisok natm̄at,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">wa nitatag namtehal netam̄at.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Veg namtan Welan hiy ige a kēy netnenen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">wa nēdēln̄an nitin̄qoy hiy natatay nonoy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">ba kē matyak nangon den ige mey a kēy gagaleg nahaphap mey nehet.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Psalm 34:12-16</char></note><verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sowo ige et mak memeh kimi veg kimi netgolgol, Ḡod tavawē kimi aē</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />?Kimi wo matatag navaksami so ak nahaphap mey netgolgol, tō ihē tak memeh kimi aē? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Ba sowo ige et mak memeh kimi veg kimi mak namgumgu mey netnenen en, Ḡod tavawē kimi aē. Nitog mētēgteg nahaphap het mey a ige sil telemyam nemtēgteg, wa tō nitog mētēgteg se kēy.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Isaiah 8:12</char></note> <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Ba atmi lep kal Kraēs mahgen nivan me Welan nonmi lelo taqami. Tō vaga kimi tēymat so vulu goy ihēte nivēhge kimi wo, “?Wō kimi dēmdēyē Ḡod bahap ōk?” <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />Ba hohole m̄ōleg mi namhuy wa mi nēdēmap, wa etgoy so tateh hap niak mamayge kimi lengon Ḡod. Yatkel et mohohole hethet bemgumgu togolgol a kimi mak hiy Kraēs. Ba kimi en, atmi vulu goy ige sil del mi nēdēmap tō so ige a hohole het en, kēy tamamayge aē.<verse eid="1PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Veg so Ḡod wo mukēg kimi so yon̄ memeh, tiy wē yeh so kimi yon̄ memeh tōtēn namgumgu togolgol den namgumgu mey nehet.<verse eid="1PE 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kraēs matamgoy negengenyeg nongēn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Veg Kraēs en, kē net tenenen ba kē moyon̄ memeh veg ige gengenyeg. Kē mamat vag tiwag ēwē bōtōti bug nagan ige sil. Kē mamat tō so nilep vasgēt kimi van hiy Ḡod. Nataqn̄ēn Kraēs en, ige mivipdeg kē so nimat, ba natalan Kraēs, Ḡod mak ēh lokse. <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />Tō kē mavatēp natalan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Navap ‘natalan’ gōh lagatgat Tikrik en, nēdēmdēm nan so natalege tiwag mi nuvu het.</char></note> ige mey a notog lēm̄ yētyēt amnō, tō nitoytoy van hiy kēy. <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />Natalan ige a kēy et mōyōs te so yon̄teg Ḡod lōqōn̄ non Noah. Lōqōn̄ nan Ḡod menyē malkōh so Noah niwos babah nabaklap. Nabaklap nan en, Ḡod mavaēh tō net vēvēh qiyig ēwē aē. Kēy bul levetēl a kē mavaēh kēy heylō den nēbē. <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Tō nēbē gōh, ikē nēvēglal nevasugyon̄ mey a nivavaēh kimi togtōakē. Ba navasugyon̄ gōh et dēmdēm nan te so oh yak nelem den nataqn̄ēmi, tateh. Ba navasugyon̄ nan en, kē navatvat mey a so niak taywah namtehal nonmi hiy Ḡod veg Tigsas Kraēs mal hatig lok den namatmat. <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />Tigsas gōh, kē mavan hag lōtōk en, tō kē mahag basay naqaqayan Ḡod a lemtō nonon. Tō kē milwo goy ige in̄sel wa ige mayanag ne vu het del.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s">Nēmētwun ige Krēstēn netegha den nēmētwun ige lolqōn̄</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Bastō, veg Kraēs moyon̄ memeh tō lataqn̄ēn en, tō atmi tēymat nēdēmdēm nonmi tō so yon̄ memeh qeleso ikē. Veg ihēte wo moyon̄ memeh latayben en, kē et gengenyeg site. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Mahē natayben nēh leptō, tō kē et tatag site namyōs het netaybege, ba kē nitatag namyōs non Ḡod vēlēs.<verse eid="1PE 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Kimi mal tog haytēyēh van lamahē nen, a kimi magagaleg tō nahaphap a ige lolqōn̄ nemyōs akak. Namyōs nonoy so legleg soloteg, namyōs het, inin memeh, vētvētqul binin, akak nahaphap mey nehet, wa mogmogo goy ige ḡod galgal a Ḡod nōlgontegoy.<verse eid="1PE 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Tō ige lolqōn̄ tohohole hethet hiy kimi aē, veg kēy mamakē aē so kimi et van tiwag site mi kēy bēvētvētqul begengenyeg. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Ba kēy tavasemlō galsi van hiy Kraēs bahaphap a kēy makak tō. Veg kē mal tēymat so vēvēg ige del, ige mey a nēh tiwag mi ige mey a mal mat vatag.<verse eid="1PE 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Veg bege gōh ige mey mal mat vatag moyon̄teg tō noyoy ēwē. Veg am̄ag, nataqn̄ey en, kēy mal lep nivipdeg bamatmat qele net. Ba natalay en, kēy tēh qele Ḡod.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nēmētwun ige Krēstēn qeleave</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Sōwlē, nōlsi haphap del mal nognog, atmi dēm m̄ōleg wa tēytēymat tō kimi tatatay galsi vēh. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Tō nitiy dēmdēm nan en, atmi togtog ba vēy tamtam kimi mi nitiy tamtam, veg natamtam tubun veteg negengenyeg m̄adeg. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Natamtam nan en, leplep vasgēt net me lēm̄ nonmi, ba nitog n̄en̄e aē. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Ḡod mohog van natapēva tegtegha ne Vu Yon̄ van hiy kimi tō so kimi vēy biyin̄ kimi. Itōk so kimi men̄ēs goy so mugumgu tēy nasgōp non Ḡod. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Net a nitoytoy en, itōk so kē nitoytoy lohohole non Ḡod. Net a nimyimyin̄ en, itōk so kē nimyin̄ mi namaymay a Ḡod melep van hiy kē. Atmi vēy biyin̄ kimi tō so lep ketket nahan Ḡod mi nage del, heylō Tigsas Kraēs. !Nēlēn̄as wa namaymay nivan lap van hiy kē vaga! Qeleanen.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kimi toyon̄ memeh qele Kraēs moyon̄ memeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Yēhē bulbulsal, nitog mamakē bevel memeh a mesew kimi qele nep, so nihil etgal kimi. Et nage bamamakē te. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Ba kimi so malaklak, veg kimi nuqultiwag mi Kraēs van a lememeh nonon, tō kimi tōyheg mi namlaklak wa mi nam̄sēksēk lōqōn̄ a Ḡod nivasemlō nēlēn̄as non Kraēs.<verse eid="1PE 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Sowo ige hohole hethet hiy kimi bōtōtē han Kraēs, ba namlaklak hiy kimi, veg Nuvu nelēn̄as non Ḡod notog apwomi.<verse eid="1PE 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Nehet so vitwag den kimi niyon̄ memeh veg kē net buwuwuh mat et, si net batan̄tan̄hephep, si net behelhel nele, si net belem̄ag. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Ba so vitwag den kimi wo moyon̄ memeh veg kē Nēkrēstēn, kē nitog mamayge aē. Ba ōlwē Ḡod aē veg nahan Kraēs van mi kē en.<verse eid="1PE 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Veg nōqōn̄ mēwēs ēgēn, tō Ḡod so nivēvēg nisil del. Tō kē niqtēg vēvēg ige nonon am̄ag. ?Ba sowo kē wo meqtēg vēvēg gēn am̄ag, ba qeleave veg ige mey a et kokm̄egoy te noyoy ēwē non Ḡod?<verse eid="1PE 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Nayapyap Yon̄ mavap so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">?Sowo et towoyig te so vaēh ige mey netnenen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">ba ige het wa ige gengenyeg en, kēy tavan lō ave?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Proverbs 11:31</char></note><verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Sōwlē, kimi mey a Ḡod mukēg kimi tō moyon̄memeh en, tiy wē yeh so kimi dēmtig im̄ey a nesey so dēmtig kē, tō m̄ōk natalami van hiy im̄ey a mitin̄ tō kimi, tō vasemlō nēdēmtig nan mi namgumgu togolgol.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s">Navatvatne hiy ige bitigtig helem̄ag ēm̄ yon̄</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Yēhē tamatmayge bitigtig helem̄ag ēm̄ yon̄, nok so hole biyin̄ kimi. Veg ino se net bitigtig helem̄ag ēm̄ yon̄, wa no met noyon̄ memeh non Kraēs, wa ino se tuqultiwag lēlēn̄as a Ḡod tavasemlō. <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />Tō nok so vap van hiy kimi so, etgoy galsi ige sipsip non Ḡod. Ḡod mal m̄ōk kimi so etgoy ige nonon. Tō kimi so mugumgu malaklak mi navaksami, ba et bemgumguteg ēwē te, si beleplep sēm yeghuquy ēwē. Itōk so kimi mayanag goy kēy mi namyōs del nonmi. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Ige tēlēm̄ yon̄ a Ḡod mōm̄ōk kēy van lemnemi en, atmi tig helem̄ag kēy mi namakaliw ēwē nonmi, ba et bēmētwumi te mey namaymay. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Tō nōqōn̄ a Ḡod tavasemlō Nitiy Et Betetgoy sipsip en, kē tōm̄ōk liqtimi nōwō-ōyōy ne lēn̄as a nangon tit hay vēhte.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Navatvatne hiy ige tēlēm̄ yon̄</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Qelese nen yēhē lōmlōmgep, atmi tog leln̄an ige tamatmayge, wa dēmbēbēw vaga. Veg,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 5:5">Ḡod niwulwulyis nangon den ige a dēmdēm liwo kēy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 5:5">ba kē nileplep van nasgōp hiy ige a kēy dēmdēmbēbēw.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Proverbs 3:34</char></note><verse eid="1PE 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Bastō atmi dēmbēbēw, tō hag lap how leln̄an Ḡod, a namnen namaymay tō so kē telep kal kimi lōqōn̄ tenenen nan. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Vel lolwon nonmi en, ukēg veteg van hiy kē, veg vaga kē nidēmdēm veg kimi.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Atmi dēm m̄ōleg wa etgoy galsi kimi den natvale nonmi, Satan. Kē qele nalayon a nivanvan kēlkēl, nimomoy, wa nisoksok net so nikuy. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Tig netnet mi nēdēmtig nonmi so tigoy kē. Wa dēmsas so vel vōnō walēg lemyam ige yathithimi wa yatētētami, kēy yon̄yon̄teg ninhet se qele kimi en.<verse eid="1PE 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Dēm lok so Ḡod Besgōp Del en, kē may ōlōl kimi heylō Kraēs Tigsas, so van hay lēlēn̄as nonon a totogtog lap vaga. Me atgiy kimi yon̄ memeh busu tekelgi ēwē, tō Ḡod mahgen tōm̄ōk galsi kimi, tak maymay kimi, tavahiy maymay kimi, wa telep van nōgōygōyimi. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />!Namaymay nivan lap van hiy kē vaga! Qeleanen.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Babah ne hohole non Pita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />No mayap neletes su gōh van hiy kimi heylō Silas. Ikē ēthēngēn mey a nok et van so kē nitiy et. No mayap neletes gōh so hole biyin̄ kimi, wa so vap lō so megōh nitiy sōgōp den Ḡod. Tig netnet lesgōp nan.<verse eid="1PE 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Nēm̄ yon̄ n̄a Babilon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Babilon </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Babilon en, kē lepnō vitwag mey a mak nehet hiy ige Juw tam̄ag. Ba Pita niōl nahan qeleso nohole lōn̄veg. Kē nihole gatay napnō mey a ige tēgvōnō akak hiy ige Krēstēn qeleso ige halvan. Wun Pita nidēmdēm hiy Rom, siso napnō tegha se. </char></note> a Ḡod movonyak tō tiwag mi kimi en, kē nivap namlaklak hiy kimi. Wa intik se, a Mak, kē se qeleanen.<verse eid="1PE 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Vap namlaklak hiy kimi, ba pōpōn kimi mi natamtam.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Natm̄at notog tiwag mi kimi del a hay mi Kraēs.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>